    "Checks that TAPCam can reach the service before first camera setup." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在首次设置相机前，检查 TAPCam 能否连接服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud view projects valid depth pixels through camera intrinsics into a lightweight camera-coordinate point preview. It is a point cloud, not cloud storage, cloud compute, or a semantic word cloud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点云视图使用相机内参，将有效深度像素投影为轻量的相机坐标系点预览。这里的点云并非云存储、云计算或语义词云。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete network access, camera, and photo library access first. Location and microphone are optional." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先完成网络、相机和照片图库访问设置。位置与麦克风为可选权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
